%% CURRENT (2026-09-17): the authenticated startup flow is auth → PER-SESSION
%% language decision (select or explicit skip) → PER-SESSION model decision
%% (backend-confirmed ready, or explicit continue-without-AI) → product. Language
%% onboarding is NOT once-per-account; language_onboarding_completed is legacy
%% metadata only. There is NO mandatory system-admission screen between them, and
%% /onboarding/model redirects to /onboarding/language while that decision is
%% missing. Canonical: docs/sequences/POST_LOGIN_STARTUP.mmd. Model/GPU readiness
%% lives in sessionStorage only, never in Supabase. auto_storage_cleanup user
%% preference removed; cleanup is a platform-wide cron (STORAGE_CAPACITY_CLEANUP.mmd).

%% Compliance onboarding, suspension, legal document routes, peer messaging and the
%% system health panel: see docs/sequences/PEER_CHAT_CREATION_BY_USERNAME.mmd,
%% docs/sequences/SYSTEM_HEALTH_AGGREGATION.mmd and docs/contracts/BACKEND_GAP_MATRIX.md.
%% The system-admission screen is OPTIONAL and no longer part of the startup order
%% (capability/admission/recommendation data is rendered on the model screen).
